</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5. </span>Experiments</h2>

<div id="S5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To assess the effectiveness of our proposed methodology, we first pre-train existing biomedical LMs with the BALI method and then assess the performance of the resulting models in various biomedical NLP tasks.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2. </span>Mean evaluation accuracy and standard deviation across 10 evaluation runs for proposed BALI alignment procedure on biomedical question answering datasets. <em id="S5.T2.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">GNN</em> stands for BALI with external GAT graph encoder while <em id="S5.T2.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Linear graph</em> stands for single-encoder implementation with KG subgraphs encoded with an LM. </figcaption>
<table id="S5.T2.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S5.T2.6.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T2.6.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;"><span id="S5.T2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></th>
<td id="S5.T2.6.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;"><span id="S5.T2.6.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">PubMedQA</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.6.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;"><span id="S5.T2.6.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MedQA</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.6.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;"><span id="S5.T2.6.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">BioASQ 2023</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.6.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T2.6.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;">PubMedBERT<sub id="S5.T2.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_sub"><span id="S5.T2.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">base</span></sub></th>
<td id="S5.T2.6.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;">63.1 <math id="S5.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> 2.9</td>
<td id="S5.T2.6.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;">38.1</td>
